01:14:31.870 --> 01:14:35.070
So, and it, and it works every time.

1859
01:14:35.070 --> 01:14:37.570
It works every time because the brain circuits

1860
01:14:37.570 --> 01:14:39.840
meaning sets of connections and chemicals

1861
